{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0509C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"专家系统是什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Peace Walker搭载的AI，最初就是作为这种专家系统开始开发的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"就是让计算机像<R=专家,EXPERT>一样做出判断的系统。算是一种代理程序。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=专家,EXPERT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"比如有个叫“Mycin”的程序，它是用来决定该开哪种抗生素的系统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"系统会不断向患者提问，逐步缩小处方药的范围。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"也就是说，想让Peace Walker开出的不是青霉素，而是热核武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"但后来发现，单纯的专家系统能力不够。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"光有专业知识，发射不了核武器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"没错。专业知识是必要的，但只有这些还不够。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"要决定是否发动报复性打击，就必须考虑更广泛的条件。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"甚至可以说，全世界的局势都要成为判断标准。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"确实。要是开错了处方，全世界都会陷入过敏性休克。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"只能在狭窄专业知识范围内判断的“弱AI”是不行的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"所以我让AI学习The Boss的思维。为了造出“强AI”……真正的专家系统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"也就是说，不能把世界交给片面的见识。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"如果只是简单的专家系统，马上就能准备好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"对了，根据任务内容决定该携带哪把枪的系统怎么样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"还是免了。我没打算把自己的生死交给别人的判断，更不用说机器了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""}]}